  "description": "The Silhouette is the women's specific version of the ultra-popular Absolute. It packs the same speed and versatility with more compact frame geometry for a better fit. Utilizes women's-specific geometry includes a shorter top tube and more standover clearance, in addition to narrower handlebars and reach-adjust brake levers for improved rider contact. FC440 Carbon blade fork saves weight and supplies a smooth and forgiving ride. Internal cable routing for a sleek look and protection from dirt and debris for consistent shifting. Shimano 105 2x11 drivetrain. Hydraulic disc brakes for ultimate stopping power. Women's specific saddle for enhanced comfort.",
